error[E0277]: `u32` is not a string, so a string bound cannot apply to it
 --> tests/ui/macros/schema_length_bound_on_a_number.rs:8:12
  |
8 |     seats: u32,
  |            ^^^ not a string
  |
  = help: the trait `Textual` is not implemented for `u32`
  = note: `min_length`, `max_length`, `pattern`, `content_encoding` and `content_media_type` apply to `String`, and to an `Option`, `Box` or `Arc` of one; implement `kynos::schema::constraints::Textual` for a newtype that is a string on the wire
  = note: or, on a `Schema` field whose serde form is a string, describe it as one with `#[schema(as = String)]`, converting through `From<&u32>` or `via = path`
  = help: the following other types implement trait `Textual`:
            Arc<T>
            Box<T>
            Nullable<T>
            Option<T>
            std::string::String
note: required by a bound in `kynos::__private::constraints::max_length`
 --> src/__private/constraints.rs
  |
  | pub fn max_length<T: Textual + ?Sized>(
  |                      ^^^^^^^ required by this bound in `max_length`
